# Slack bot token (xoxb-…) with channels:history, channels:read, users:read, chat:write
# (+ canvases:read, canvases:write, files:read when AMBIENT_STATE=canvas).
# The bot must be a member of every channel it watches.
SLACK_BOT_TOKEN=
# Signing secret (Basic Information → App Credentials). Enables POST /slack/events so an
# @-mention ticks the channel immediately; without it mentions are seen on the next cadence.
SLACK_SIGNING_SECRET=
# Channels are not configured: the bot watches every channel it is a member of.
# /invite @Ambient to start, /kick to stop. Membership is re-listed every AMBIENT_DISCOVERY_MS (default 5 min).
# A model key the catalog knows (any one of these).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# Optional
# AMBIENT_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-6
# AMBIENT_EVERY=*/10 * * * *
# AMBIENT_MAX_POSTS_PER_DAY=5
# AMBIENT_TOKENS_PER_DAY=500000
# AMBIENT_STATE=sqlite          # or `canvas`: the document lives in the channel canvas, humans can edit it
# AMBIENT_ADMIN_TOKEN=          # protects /channels/* when set
# AMBIENT_DB=file:./ambient.db
# PORT=8790
